            "review_title": "Review at Le Royal Saigon",
            "review_text": "Jan H\nBroome, Australia4 contributions\n1\nWonderful food\nMay 2019 • Couples\nOne of the highlights of our recent trip to Vietnam was Le Royal, situated in the Majestic Hotel in Saigon. Street food in Vietnam ia inexpensive and great, however if you want a fine dining experience this is the place to go. We ate there twice and thoroughly enjoyed every dish we had.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 11, 2019",
