            "review_text": "wolfgang856\nHesse, Germany128 contributions\n0\nRoyal feeling at HCMC.\nSep 2017 • Couples\nLe Royal Restaurant is locatet at, respectively next door (throughway) to, stunning Majestic Hotel. Currently a new startup restaurant, formerly running under the umbrella of Majestic Hotel at Saigon river. Amazing menue sets at +- 1.000.00 VND. Very tasty and also very nice designed food. Good value for price. Good explanation of each part of menue by friendly motivated staff. My recommendation on average €€€-€€€€!\nRead more\nWritten February 27, 2018",
