            "review_text": "zevsbumper\nSt Just, United Kingdom15 contributions\n0\nWe were treated like royalty!\nJan 2018 • Couples\nWe wandered into Le Royal as it is in the Majestic Hotel....\nWe were the only guests and each selected a different menu.\nI selected Set 5 and my wife Set 1 (see website for details).\nWe were presented with little filo pastry tarts filled with avocado cream and ginger - delicious!\nThe next complimentary treat was a glass of champagne each and then our meal started......\nEach dish arrived beautifully executed and faultlessly served by our lovely waitress in traditional costume.\nEverything was so perfect and paced just right that it is difficult not to layer on the superlatives.\nHowever the key element of fine dining is the food and these people just got it all perfectly right: balance, spicing and ingredients. \nMy wife’s standout dish was her starter of red dragon fruit and pomelo salad; mine was the dessert of Nha Trang bird’s nest soup with tropical fruits.\nGet yourself to HCMC and try this - you will not regret it!\nRead more\nWritten January 25, 2018",
