            "review_text": "snapi\nFeilding, New Zealand36 contributions\n0\nWe dined like royalty\nOct 2017 • Couples\nWhere do I start? Staff 10/10, food 10/10, presentation 10/10, art on a plate. Taste 10/10. Decor 10/10. We cannot fault our beautiful experience here tonight. We choose a set menu and we're beyond delighted. This is what living is about. Love, food and beautiful people. Highly recommended.\nWritten October 9, 2017",
